    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rerank: model compute vs wall-clock (p95)",
      "description": "Two timers over the SAME call. 'wall-clock' is what the stage histogram records: asyncio.to_thread + wait_for, so it also counts any time the call spent waiting for the event loop. 'model compute' times model.predict alone, with the one-off model load deliberately outside the timer. This split was added to test a specific claim -- that rerank latency was mostly scheduling delay, not the model. It disproved it: measured 2026-09-20 both lines sat at 2.2s p95 and their means differed by 0.5ms. The wall-clock IS the model, so the rerank timeouts are CPU cost and a faster/smaller model is the only lever that moves them. If these two lines ever SEPARATE, the gap is the loop, not the reranker -- read the loop-lag panel beside this one before touching the reranker.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(anime_retrieval_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{stage=\"rerank\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "wall-clock (stage timer)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(anime_retrieval_rerank_compute_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "model compute p95",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(anime_retrieval_rerank_compute_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "model compute p50",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "id": 26
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Event-loop lag (the control for the panel left)",
      "description": "A background task sleeps 250ms and records how much LONGER than 250ms it actually took. That overshoot is the event loop's queueing delay, and it is the control for the rerank panel: it is the only way to tell 'the model is slow' from 'the loop was busy'. Healthy here 2026-09-20: p50 0.46ms, p95 0.97ms, p99 3.5ms. A loop blocked by CPU work measures ~966ms (reproduced in test_loop_monitor). While these lines stay sub-millisecond, no request latency anywhere on this dashboard can be blamed on scheduling -- which is exactly what it proved for the reranker.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(anime_runtime_loop_lag_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(anime_runtime_loop_lag_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(anime_runtime_loop_lag_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 31
      },
      "id": 27
